BenchHand - licence overview
Copyright (c) 2026 Martin Faltus (mafaltu)

BenchHand is open source hardware and open source software. Each part of this
repository is licensed as follows; the full licence texts are in the files named.

  hardware/   (KiCad design files, fabrication data, BOM, hardware docs)
              CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal
              (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)                      -> hardware/LICENSE

  firmware/   (firmware source code, build files, firmware docs)
              GNU General Public License v3.0 or later
              (GPL-3.0-or-later)                    -> firmware/LICENSE
              Bundled libraries in firmware/lib/ keep their own licences
              (TinyUSB: MIT, ST HAL: BSD-3-Clause, CMSIS: Apache-2.0).

  enclosure/, docs/, README.md, images
              Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
              (CC-BY-SA-4.0)                        -> enclosure/LICENSE

"BenchHand" is the name of this project. Derivatives are welcome under the
licences above, but please do not sell them under the name BenchHand.
